# Wine 11.18 mshtml fixes needed for TEBEOS' Medula integration
# 1) IHTMLElementRender (DrawToDC)   - interface was missing entirely; renders the
#    element's current pixels by forcing a synchronous Gecko repaint
#    (nsIDOMWindowUtils::Redraw) and blitting the element's viewport rectangle.
# 2) HTMLElement_setAttribute("value",...)" on <input> mirrors to the value
#    *property* (Gecko never reflects it into type=password) - fixes the password.
# 3) HTMLElement_getAttribute        - return the raw attribute (IE8+ behaviour)
# 4) DOMKeyboardEvent_get_keyCode    - char code on keypress (IE behaviour)
# 5) HTMLImgElement_get_href         - alias of src (was E_NOTIMPL)

